&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform data analysis and evaluate machine learning or statistical models using Python, as well as basic SQL foundations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity, humility, drive and teamwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use modern agentic tooling (Claude Code, Codex, …) efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
