&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Customer Experience Manager, HELOC&lt;/strong&gt; will lead a&amp;nbsp; team of Customer Experience (CX) agents responsible for supporting borrowers and applicants throughout their HELOC journey. This leader will manage all inbound customer communication channels—including phone, email, and future chat support—and will play a significant strategic role in shaping how customers interact with our Home Equity products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role works closely with cross-functional stakeholders from the following teams, quality, TPM, product,telephony and compliance. The ideal candidate combines strong people leadership with deep operational rigor, process thinking, and a passion for designing frictionless, empathetic customer interactions. As we move toward launching a white-glove lending partner experience, this person will champion a service model that delivers best-in-class support—whether self-service or person-to-person.&lt;/p&gt;
