&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 + years of people management experience demonstrating strong leadership and interpersonal skills, with the ability to motivate and inspire others to achieve their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience working in the Home Lending industry at a Financial Institution or Mortgage company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience working with telephony systems building workflows and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem solving skills with the ability to identify issues and develop thoughtful data driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relentless drive for qualitative and quantitative improvement in customer sentiment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
