&lt;p&gt;Upstart’s Auto Retail Dealer Success Management team is a critical part of the company, voicing the needs and suggestions of our dealer customers in product development. The team builds long-lasting, mutually beneficial dealer relationships focused on delivering quality service and support, and generates retail contracts that satisfy our borrowers’ needs while meeting each dealer’s business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Dealer Success Manager – Auto Retail (Southeast) at Upstart, you will play a pivotal role as the main point of contact for dealers in your assigned Southeast market. You’ll drive retail growth, onboard new partners, and serve as the ultimate product ambassador — part consultant, part strategist, and part relationship-builder, bringing the voice of the dealer back to our product and engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
