&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience owning strategy, roadmap, metrics, and delivery for a technical, transactional, or customer-facing product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with payments, money movement, loan servicing, billing, or a related financial product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using quantitative analysis to diagnose product problems, evaluate tradeoffs, and guide product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with Engineering and cross-functional teams to deliver products, systems, or platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling a platform used by internal product or engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience increasing leverage from&amp;nbsp; existing systems to drive business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in consumer finance, fintech, or another regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
