&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics, or a related field, or its equivalent, plus &lt;strong&gt;4 years of software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing production software in Python and working with Java, Kotlin, or another strongly typed programming language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, building, and operating scalable APIs, distributed systems, or microservices in a cloud environment such as AWS or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning the technical design and delivery of complex software projects from development through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production systems with requirements related to scalability, latency, reliability, or correctness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WWi61dk6GplSJL-5-WN2utH1rp0XHx-5iWpWNFik3sE/edit?tab=t.4n9ts7b53c0o#bookmark=id.jloa0k1jb1im&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of fintech, financial systems, financial mathematics, statistics, machine learning platforms, or decisioning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on business-critical systems that affect revenue, profitability, risk, or core product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems, cloud-native architecture, platform engineering, continuous integration and deployment, or infrastructure as code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with data science and product teams to productionize models, decisioning logic, or experimentation capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively across engineering and non-engineering teams on technically complex initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
