&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics, or a related field (or its equivalent), plus 3 years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing production software using one or more general-purpose programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, building, testing, and operating production software or infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cloud infrastructure, distributed systems, deployment systems, developer tooling, or backend services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience independently delivering well-scoped software engineering projects from technical design through production operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI assisted development tools across multiple stages of the software engineering lifecycle, with an interest in continually evolving how you use these tools as their capabilities advance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes, AWS, containers, and infrastructure as code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of deployment platforms, release automation, internal developer platforms, or developer tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with progressive delivery practices such as canary deployments, automated health analysis, and rollback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GitOps or deployment technologies such as Argo CD, Helm, or similar systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI-assisted development tools across the software engineering lifecycle or building AI-enabled developer workflows and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
