&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Background in finance / fintech, financial mathematics, statistics, or machine learning preferred but not required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;History of thriving in diverse work environments: both collaborative and self-directed; remote and in-person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Deep experience with distributed systems, cloud-native development, and advanced CI/CD pipelines (infrastructure-as-code focus).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Recognized as a subject matter expert or technical owner for a critical domain, with a passion for sharing knowledge and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
