&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; at Upstart, you will own the monitoring and reporting of model and credit performance for Personal Loans. This role provides regular visibility to senior leadership and plays a key role in shaping data-driven decisions at the highest levels of the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
