&lt;p&gt;5+ years of experience in web production, website management, or marketing web operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience building, updating, and publishing pages in WordPress, Instapage, or comparable CMS and self-serve landing page platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing web projects from request intake through launch, including production schedules, cross-functional dependencies, and approvals.&lt;/p&gt;
